# Primeval Bounty: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put three +1/+1 counters on target creature you control" (CR 603.2,
# 122.1). On turn 3 Bot1 casts Giant Growth (Mox Emerald) on the Grizzly Bears, and the cast trigger targets the Beast token
# instead: the trigger's target is chosen independently of the spell's. The Beast gets three counters (6/6) and the Bears just
# the pump (6/5); no second Beast is made, since Giant Growth is not a creature spell.

